    "name": "board",
    "description": "The task board in the person's side pane: top goals (To do, Doing, Done), each with its own subtasks. When the person asks for real work (not a yes/no, a question or a one-word reply), call inbox with their ask: a small model files it as a goal or a subtask. Do not decide where it goes yourself. Messages the person queues while you work are filed by themselves: do not send them again. Your own to-do list goes under the goal in Doing by itself: do not add its items again. Actions: list (cards and ids, subtasks indented), add (title, optional note, column, parent), move (card, column), remove (card, with its subtasks), inbox (text)."
